meta {
  name: Create Daily Log - Education
  type: http
  seq: 9
}

post {
  url: {{baseURL}}/v1/house/{{houseId}}/young-persons/{{youngPersonId}}/daily-logs
  body: multipartForm
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

body:multipart-form {
  chronology_id: 7
  activity_action: Attended school - full day. Completed English and Maths assignments. Teacher reported good engagement in Science practical. Homework: Complete reading chapter 5 for tomorrow.
  mood[0]: Engaged
  mood[1]: Content
  breakfast: Cereal and fruit
  lunch: School lunch - pizza and salad
  dinner: Chicken curry with rice
  ~attachments[0]: @file(/path/to/homework_assignment.pdf)
  ~attachments[1]: @file(/path/to/teacher_report.pdf)
}

docs {
  # Create Daily Log - Education
  
  Document education-related activities and academic progress.
  
  ## Required Fields
  - `chronology_id` (integer): Must be 7 (Education)
  
  **Note:** `date`, `log_date_time`, and `day_part` are automatically set by the server.
  - `activity_action` (string): Educational activities and observations
  
  ## What to Document
  
  ### School Attendance
  - Full day / Half day / Absent
  - Reasons for absence if applicable
  - Punctuality
  
  ### Academic Activities
  - Subjects studied
  - Assignments completed
  - Homework given
  - Tests or assessments
  - Projects worked on
  
  ### Engagement & Progress
  - Participation level
  - Understanding of material
  - Challenges faced
  - Achievements and strengths
  - Areas needing support
  
  ### Teacher Feedback
  - Reports from teachers
  - Behaviour in class
  - Social interactions
  - Areas of concern or praise
  
  ### Support Provided
  - Additional tutoring
  - Study sessions at home
  - Educational resources used
  - Assistance with homework
  
  ## Optional Fields
  - `day_part` (string): Auto-detected
  - `mood` (array): Attitude towards learning
  - `breakfast`, `lunch`, `dinner`: Meals (especially school lunch)
  - `attachments` (files): Homework, reports, certificates
  
  ## Example Entries
  
  ### Full School Day
  ```
  Attended school 9am-3pm. All lessons attended. Maths: working on 
  fractions, needed extra support. English: presented book review, 
  received positive feedback. PE: participated fully in football.
  Homework: Maths worksheet pages 12-14.
  ```
  
  ### Home Education
  ```
  Home tutoring session 10am-12pm. Covered English comprehension and 
  creative writing. YP wrote a short story about their recent visit 
  to the zoo. Showed improvement in spelling and grammar. Afternoon: 
  Science video lesson on ecosystems, completed quiz with 85% score.
  ```
  
  ### Remote Learning
  ```
  Online lessons via video conference. Joined English and History 
  classes. Technical issues at start but resolved. Submitted coursework 
  on time. Teacher praised essay on World War II.
  ```
  
  ### Educational Trips
  ```
  School trip to Science Museum. YP very engaged, asked many questions. 
  Particularly interested in space exhibition. Completed worksheet 
  during visit. Good behaviour throughout.
  ```
  
  ## Response (201 Created)
  Returns the created education log entry.
}
